All server-side commands run inside a **Frappe bench** where this app is installed as `healthcare`.

## Install / setup

```sh
bench get-app https://github.com/Tacten/biograph
bench --site <site> install-app healthcare
bench setup requirements --dev
```

## Tests (same command as CI)

```sh
bench --site test_site run-parallel-tests --app healthcare
# or one doctype/module
bench --site <site> run-tests --app healthcare --doctype "Lab Test"
```

## Lint / format

```sh
pip install pre-commit && pre-commit install
npm install            # eslint deps
pre-commit run --all-files   # ruff --fix, ruff-format, prettier, eslint, detect-secrets, pip-audit, yaml/json/toml/ast checks
```

Semgrep (the CI `semgrep` job):

```sh
git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/frappe/semgrep-rules.git .frappe-semgrep-rules
pip install semgrep
semgrep ci --config ./.frappe-semgrep-rules/rules --config r/python.lang.correctness
```

## Patient portal frontend

```sh
yarn install          # root postinstall also installs patient_portal
yarn build            # = cd patient_portal && vite build --base=/assets/healthcare/patient_portal/
cd patient_portal && yarn dev   # vite dev server proxied to frappe
```

## Desk assets

```sh
bench build --app healthcare
```

## Migrations

```sh
bench --site <site> migrate   # runs patches.txt and after_migrate
```
